@HostAddress = http://localhost:5020

### Submit a run (feeds the leaderboard once wired to Redis)
POST {{HostAddress}}/profile/bobby/run/run-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levelName": "level-1",
  "asOf": "2026-07-13T12:00:00Z",
  "duration": 42.5,
  "score": 1000
}

### Get the leaderboard for a level
GET {{HostAddress}}/leaderboard/level-1